    "operatingTempMax": "The Recommended Operating Conditions give TA -40 to 85 C, which is what the description specifies the part over. The packaging addendum on page 29 shows -40 to 125 in its own Op temp column, and the electrical table is headed TJ -40 to 150 C.",
